#. module: payment_kashier_cf
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_kashier_cf
msgid ""
"Payment provider for Kashier. Every Kashier method is its own payment "
"method: cards (Visa, Mastercard, Meeza, 3-D Secure), Apple Pay, mobile "
"wallets, InstaPay, Basata kiosk codes, bank installments, valU, Souhoola, "
"Contact, Aman, Forsa, Octo, MoGo and TRU; the methods the Kashier account "
"doesn't accept are hidden. Each method runs on Kashier's page, on Kashier's "
"page shown inside the checkout, or server side (wallet requests, Basata "
"codes and InstaPay QR codes shown by Odoo; cards always stay on Kashier's "
"page). Apple Pay can also be a button on the payment step. Payments are "
"confirmed from Kashier's API, never from the browser alone. Includes saved "
"cards (also charged again without the customer, for subscriptions and "
"invoices), refunds, authorize and capture, payment notifications, a status "
"check every 15 minutes, a typed client of Kashier's API, and Arabic."
msgstr ""

